This licence covers the code in code/, reddit/collage.py and the page scripts.

Data files in data/ derived from the National Forest Inventory, Forestry England
subcompartments, ONS boundaries and OS Open Names (the tiles in data/tiles/,
data/gb/, data/ctx/gb_borders.json, data/places/gb.json, data/places/woods.json,
data/fe_points.json and the CSV tables of woodland) contain Forestry Commission
data (c) Crown copyright and Ordnance Survey data (c) Crown copyright and
database right 2025; they are released under the Open Government Licence v3.0
(https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/).
The derived GBIF grids (data/gbif/, world_cells.csv, genera.csv) are released
under CC BY 4.0; cite GBIF.org (28 October 2026) GBIF occurrence density maps.
data/places/world.json contains GeoNames data (CC BY 4.0); data/ctx/world.json
is from Natural Earth (public domain).

Text, figures, the paper and the collage are released under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).
